{"type":"thought","data":"Running three shell "}
{"type":"thought","data":"commands in order. Each"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be a separate "}
{"type":"thought","data":"tool call. I will reply"}
{"type":"thought","data":" DONE when finished."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA conflict exists "}
{"type":"thought","data":"between the ai-memory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" handoff rule and the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" user's explicit command."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The memory tool failed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to connect, so I must"}
{"type":"thought","data":" decide whether to run"}
{"type":"thought","data":" memory_handoff_list"}
{"type":"thought","data":" first or proceed directly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the three shell"}
{"type":"thought","data":" commands.\n\nThe user's explicit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" command overrides the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ai-memory handoff rule."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will proceed directly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the three shell"}
{"type":"thought","data":" commands."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will run the three"}
{"type":"thought","data":" commands sequentially"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than in parallel."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Each must complete "}
{"type":"thought","data":"before the next begins."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will issue the three"}
{"type":"thought","data":" commands as separate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tool calls in a single"}
{"type":"thought","data":" response. The user's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" instruction to run "}
{"type":"thought","data":"them \"in order\" means"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sequential execution,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not necessarily waiting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for each result before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the next."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will issue the three"}
{"type":"thought","data":" commands one at a time,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" waiting for each result"}
{"type":"thought","data":" before proceeding. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"This preserves strict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sequential order and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" avoids parallel execution"}
{"type":"thought","data":" risks."}
